#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:5
#: aa232d1c9036457c993f1fb6862de059
msgid "Ainstein LR-D1 Long Range Radar Altimeter"
msgstr "Ainstein LR-D1 远程雷达高度计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:7
#: 1d4a9a4ba8ec4701b4e1d7151a39b5e3
msgid ""
"The `Ainstein LR-D1 Long Range Radar Altimeter "
"<https://ainstein.ai/lr-d1-uav-long-range-radar-altimeter/>`__ has a range "
"of 500m, an update rate of 40hz and weighs 300g."
msgstr ""
"`Ainstein LR-D1 远程雷达高度计 <https://ainstein.ai/lr-d1-uav-long-range-radar-"
"altimeter/>`__ 量程为 500m，更新频率为 40hz，重量 300g。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:13
#: 4811a63d8ac143659b01c65399e937a9
msgid ""
"Support for this sensor is available in ArduPilot firmware versions 4.6 and "
"later"
msgstr "ArduPilot 固件版本 4.6 及更高版本支持此传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:15
#: 20bb2838cafe41fd8f65573396e7a5a6
msgid ""
"The user manual for this radar unit can be found `here. "
"<https://ainstein.ai/wp-content/uploads/LR-D1-Technical-User-"
"Manual.docx.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""
"该雷达单元的用户手册可在 `此处 <https://ainstein.ai/wp-content/uploads/LR-D1-Technical-"
"User-Manual.docx.pdf>`__ 查阅。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:19
#: da1d39ef0d044b1c95c82fc281095e86
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:21
#: ddc6097948df4bba91b2566198189e99
msgid ""
"Units can be purchased through `Ainstein's website. "
"<https://ainstein.ai/>`__"
msgstr "可通过 `Ainstein 官网 <https://ainstein.ai/>`__ 购买。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:24
#: 026e6fc0ada9421c80341ad90bb2c1e3
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:26
#: be5cad8be528478880658ebaffdca3a0
msgid "The LR-D1 is available in serial and DroneCAN versions."
msgstr "LR-D1 提供串口和 DroneCAN 两种版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:28
#: ac63b441af324525a73bc8054d6b6754
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare Serial/UART port.  The example"
" below shows how to connect to SERIAL4 as the first rangefinder."
msgstr "串口连接可使用任意空闲的 Serial/UART 端口。以下示例演示如何将 SERIAL4 配置为第一个测距仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:30
#: 0b4c2786c6094cb49c9ebd9184c6cafb
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:31
#: 24caefdd9b344f6b9ffc79e193021b82
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:32
#: fc8073677c2a41299911b3eba7d4bf37
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 42 (Ainstein_LR_D1)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 42（Ainstein_LR_D1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:33
#: ef56e251d3e3497fa83de9c44437e930
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 1.0"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 1.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:34
#: 7a1432b6a1644e9d90b4902eadcd9efd
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 500"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 500"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:35
#: bab03ce88501412faf57e016efb724a9
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in meters from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更准确地说，是飞行器着陆时测距仪到地面的距离（单位：米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装位置。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:38
#: b58c8035bb98464d9a7e503a4e76588e
msgid "Testing the sensor"
msgstr "传感器测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ainstein-lrd1.rst:40
#: 1d0b1118f71542ce9c382d8cef8dcad7
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\"."
msgstr "传感器读取的距离可在 Mission Planner 飞行数据界面的状态标签页中查看。请注意查找 「rangefinder1」。"
